{"severity":"error","file":"errors/realtime_mixed_1.march","start_line":20,"start_col":2,"end_line":22,"end_col":5,"message":"The function `step` takes `Tagged(_, Realtime)` but also takes `Cap(IO)`.\nRealtime functions cannot hold `Cap(IO)` — allocation, IO, and panic are excluded from realtime contexts.\nhint: remove `Cap(IO)`","code":"realtime_mixed","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CONTRACT"}
